Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:57:23 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Demo helpers: RealSense build, waypoint patrol,
 whisper_trt option

- install_realsense_jetson.sh: build librealsense (RSUSB backend, no kernel
  patch) with Python bindings for the conda Python 3.8 and place pyrealsense2
  in the env (no aarch64 pip wheel works on the Jetson). Adapted from
  JetsonHacks installRealSenseSDK.
- patrol.sh: save waypoints from the current TF pose (--add) and drive through
  them with goto.sh, stopping so the observer records; Foxy has neither
  nav2_simple_commander nor the wait-at-waypoint plugin.
- voice_query.py --trt: NVIDIA-AI-IOT/whisper_trt (TensorRT) when installed,
  falling back to openai-whisper.
- robot/README.md: "Demo helpers" section.

